o revive his family's bonds before the end of summer vacation, but stuck together in a restored microbus, workaholic Momma, communist-in-training Junior, and social-media-baby Goldie have a lot more to fight about than unite over. Meanwhile, the open road is under threat; you'll have to get in the construction groove to take on corrupt Senator Joseph McCarthief\u2019s attempts to turn all freeways into pay-to-drive tunnels and reclaim your right to transportation.\n\nAccessibility Considerations:\none-button controls\ncaptioning\ndyslexia friendly fonts\nartificial locomotion incl. snap turning, smooth moving\nheight calibration\none-controller mode\nno-reach 3DoF mode\nbuttons-only mode\nfull button remapping", "short_description": "Snap together inconvenient road pieces to build ridiculously convoluted highways, and guide the dysfunctional Flowers family on a psychedelic road trip across post-infrastructure America."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://latestageinteractive.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Late Stage Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://detourbus.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "787528972229383"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://sco